WEBVTT

00:25.520 --> 00:26.600
Good morning.

00:27.400 --> 00:28.680
My name is Nanno.

00:29.240 --> 00:30.440
I'm 16 years old.

00:31.480 --> 00:33.000
Today is my first day.

00:33.400 --> 00:34.600
Please take care of me.

00:37.200 --> 00:38.760
From what I can remember,

00:39.160 --> 00:41.040
Nanno enrolled
in the middle of the semester.

00:41.360 --> 00:44.120
And she was always
on the phone with her boyfriend.

00:45.480 --> 00:46.880
Yes, Tan.

00:47.200 --> 00:48.040
Yes.

00:48.120 --> 00:49.760
You're always talking to your boyfriend.

00:49.840 --> 00:51.600
Don't you want to spend some time
with your friends?

00:52.760 --> 00:54.480
Oh, my god.

00:54.560 --> 00:56.000
It's so big.

00:56.080 --> 00:58.680
Tan must love Nanno very much.

00:58.760 --> 00:59.800
I think

00:59.880 --> 01:01.800
something is up with this Tan guy.

01:04.000 --> 01:04.840
Do you want to prove it?

01:04.920 --> 01:05.760
CONTACTS

01:05.840 --> 01:06.680
Shit.

01:06.760 --> 01:08.240
There's nothing here.

01:08.800 --> 01:11.320
Nanno who was always on her phone

01:11.400 --> 01:13.120
was actually talking to...

01:13.760 --> 01:14.920
the void.

01:20.320 --> 01:22.280
PSYCHO BITCH
CRAZY BITCH TALKING TO NOTHING

01:27.200 --> 01:28.200
It seems like

01:28.280 --> 01:29.640
she disappeared after that day.

01:29.720 --> 01:31.200
Hi, everyone.

01:33.360 --> 01:34.280
It's me, Nanno.

01:34.360 --> 01:35.880
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

01:35.960 --> 01:37.800
It's me, Nanno. Nanno.

01:37.880 --> 01:38.960
Nanno.

01:40.880 --> 01:43.720
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

01:43.800 --> 01:45.280
You remember Nanno now?

01:45.800 --> 01:46.640
Thap.

01:46.720 --> 01:49.400
I see you're having a party,

01:49.880 --> 01:52.040
so I definitely can't come empty-handed.

01:53.160 --> 01:54.400
Right, Tan?

01:55.840 --> 01:59.000
Nanno. It's me, Nanno.

02:00.520 --> 02:01.880
Nanno.

02:03.520 --> 02:04.880
Nanno.

03:27.040 --> 03:28.840
Why are you so quiet?

03:29.480 --> 03:31.680
You don't you want
to talk to me anymore, Tan?

03:45.360 --> 03:47.160
Tan can't come here again?

03:48.480 --> 03:50.120
I had to wait for nothing again.

03:50.200 --> 03:53.360
Will I ever get to meet Tan in this life?

03:55.960 --> 03:58.000
I will go to the bathroom.

03:59.160 --> 04:00.040
Okay.

04:04.200 --> 04:07.400
I think something is up with this Tan guy.

04:10.760 --> 04:12.320
Do you want to prove it?

04:16.240 --> 04:17.880
CONTACTS

04:18.959 --> 04:19.839
CALL

04:19.920 --> 04:20.839
CALLING...

04:28.120 --> 04:30.920
Nanno, I can't talk right now.
I'm with Wit and the guys.

04:31.400 --> 04:33.120
Let's talk when we meet tonight, okay?

04:35.680 --> 04:37.160
Nanno? Is something wrong?

04:37.240 --> 04:38.640
Are you okay?

04:40.280 --> 04:41.120
Don't be mad.

04:41.200 --> 04:43.320
Fong is already suspicious.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.640
Was that...

04:54.720 --> 04:56.640
Thap's voice?

04:56.720 --> 04:58.520
Are you deaf?

04:58.760 --> 05:01.760
If that wasn't Thap's voice,
then who the fuck was it?

05:01.840 --> 05:05.400
What? I just wanted to make sure.
Did I do something wrong?

05:05.480 --> 05:06.720
Yes, you did.

05:06.800 --> 05:08.240
Can't you see Fong is stressed?

05:08.320 --> 05:10.000
Can you guys shut up?

05:18.600 --> 05:20.160
Let's go slap that bitch.

05:21.160 --> 05:23.080
Yeah. Slap the slut out of her.

05:24.200 --> 05:25.480
If I were you,

05:26.200 --> 05:28.320
I would kill her.

05:28.520 --> 05:29.360
Yeah.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.680
I'll make her wish she was dead.

05:33.440 --> 05:34.440
Just you wait.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.480
Let's go for ice cream.

05:45.680 --> 05:47.400
Tan is busy,

05:48.520 --> 05:50.040
but I'm free.

05:57.040 --> 05:58.320
Is there...

05:59.320 --> 06:00.640
something wrong?

06:01.760 --> 06:03.400
Why are you acting weird?

06:04.080 --> 06:06.200
No. It's nothing.

06:07.280 --> 06:08.720
There's something we need to do.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.160
That's fine.

06:14.360 --> 06:16.040
Let's eat some ice cream next time, then.

06:16.120 --> 06:18.360
With or without Tan.

06:24.000 --> 06:25.680
After that,

06:25.760 --> 06:29.560
Fong, the angel and my good friend,

06:30.120 --> 06:33.400
spread the rumor to other people

06:33.480 --> 06:35.640
that I was talking to the void.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.000
Right?

06:38.000 --> 06:39.640
You thought I didn't know that?

06:42.000 --> 06:44.000
Our fling ended a long time ago.

06:44.760 --> 06:46.160
What more do you want?

06:48.880 --> 06:50.840
How can it possibly end

06:52.000 --> 06:53.480
when I'm still

06:54.280 --> 06:55.920
in love with you?

07:03.000 --> 07:05.640
As soon as I became the school's gossip,

07:06.240 --> 07:08.960
Tan permanently disappeared
from this world.

07:29.480 --> 07:31.440
Until one day,

07:31.520 --> 07:32.440
NANNO. CAN WE MEET AT OUR SPOT?

07:32.520 --> 07:33.840
Tan changed his mind.

08:01.360 --> 08:04.000
NANNO. CAN WE MEET AT OUR SPOT?

09:09.960 --> 09:11.280
Help.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.400
Help me.

09:14.680 --> 09:15.840
Tan.

09:26.120 --> 09:27.320
Why, Fong?

09:29.400 --> 09:31.040
Why did you have to do that?

09:31.640 --> 09:33.800
Why did you have to resort
to such violence?

09:34.800 --> 09:36.480
What if she died?

09:37.920 --> 09:38.840
Because of you,

09:39.680 --> 09:42.080
I can be dragged down with this.
Did you know that?

09:44.240 --> 09:46.000
I can't stand this anymore.

09:52.800 --> 09:54.200
I'm breaking up with you.

10:03.080 --> 10:04.080
Thap.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.160
Fong.

10:17.160 --> 10:18.480
Fong, don't!

10:19.480 --> 10:20.400
Fong.

10:26.920 --> 10:28.760
Thap, don't leave me.

11:19.040 --> 11:20.520
That was probably the first cut

11:21.680 --> 11:24.240
that you used to tie Tan with yourself.

11:26.080 --> 11:27.800
I wonder

11:28.480 --> 11:30.400
how many cuts you need

11:31.520 --> 11:33.600
to tie another human being with yourself.

11:35.760 --> 11:38.520
Actually, I'm not so sure

11:38.600 --> 11:41.320
who's more psychopathic

11:42.000 --> 11:43.840
between the two of us.

11:45.120 --> 11:47.080
You might have thought that you won,

11:47.160 --> 11:49.840
but the fact that Tan
is still with you to this day

11:50.840 --> 11:53.000
is because that's how I wanted it to be.

12:07.640 --> 12:09.000
Right, Tan?

12:10.880 --> 12:12.720
You're still with Fong

12:13.200 --> 12:15.440
because you can't leave her.

12:16.240 --> 12:18.120
You don't want to feel guilty.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.160
You have to stay.

12:22.160 --> 12:23.640
Just like what you told Proud.

12:27.760 --> 12:28.960
Right?

12:30.200 --> 12:31.560
Fong, don't listen to her.

12:31.840 --> 12:33.160
She's lying.

12:33.840 --> 12:35.920
Just think carefully, Fong.

12:36.440 --> 12:40.080
Why is your pretty best friend

12:40.920 --> 12:43.000
still single?

12:45.000 --> 12:46.920
Besides, Proud is a flight attendant,

12:47.680 --> 12:50.440
and Thap is a pilot.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.360
It's quite convenient, really.

13:20.000 --> 13:21.560
Fong, it's really nothing.

13:22.560 --> 13:24.560
We were on the same flight,
so Thap picked me up.

13:25.080 --> 13:26.720
Really, Fong. It's nothing.

13:26.800 --> 13:28.360
They were just on the same flight.

13:28.440 --> 13:30.160
That's why Thap came to pick Proud up.

13:43.800 --> 13:45.280
-That's your friend, dude.
-Oh, my god.

13:51.680 --> 13:52.680
Thap, you asshole.

13:58.800 --> 14:00.200
I finally caught you.

14:04.720 --> 14:05.720
Fong...

14:06.160 --> 14:08.640
That was a setup.

14:10.200 --> 14:11.160
You bitch!

14:11.240 --> 14:13.120
-Hey.
-Hey, Fong.

14:13.200 --> 14:14.840
-I also have a clip
-Calm down, Fong.

14:14.920 --> 14:17.000
of them on a bed in a room together.

14:17.080 --> 14:18.560
Don't you want to watch that, too?

14:18.640 --> 14:20.320
-Fong.
-Do you want to fight with me?

14:20.400 --> 14:21.880
-Hey, calm down.
-Let me go!

14:21.960 --> 14:22.920
Fong, enough.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.080
-Let me go!
-Fong.

14:24.160 --> 14:27.120
Let me go! How can you do this to me?

14:27.200 --> 14:28.920
How can you do this to me?

14:29.000 --> 14:31.720
It's because you're like this!
This is why I have someone else.

14:48.800 --> 14:49.920
Proud, are you all right?

14:50.760 --> 14:51.840
Get up carefully.

14:56.800 --> 14:58.440
Poor girl.

15:00.160 --> 15:04.240
You even quit your job
to take care of Thap,

15:04.320 --> 15:05.680
and to tend the house.

15:06.400 --> 15:07.760
In the end,

15:08.360 --> 15:10.680
all you got is nothing.

15:33.480 --> 15:34.560
This is it.

15:34.640 --> 15:36.480
The old Fong.

16:03.280 --> 16:04.800
How could you do that to me?

16:05.520 --> 16:06.880
-Fong, stop.
-Fong.

16:06.960 --> 16:07.880
Fong, stop.

16:07.960 --> 16:10.000
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

16:10.080 --> 16:11.240
It's you!

16:11.680 --> 16:13.560
You made me crazy!

16:18.480 --> 16:20.280
Are you crazy?

16:46.040 --> 16:47.000
Thap.

16:47.480 --> 16:49.640
Don't be too harsh on Fong.

17:00.400 --> 17:02.360
If you don't feel sorry for Fong,

17:07.920 --> 17:10.079
just feel sorry for the child
in her belly.

17:20.880 --> 17:21.800
What?

17:22.280 --> 17:23.800
Fong didn't tell you?

17:24.599 --> 17:27.440
Fong has been pregnant
for over three months already.

17:28.400 --> 17:29.240
Fong!

17:29.320 --> 17:31.320
Fong.

17:33.440 --> 17:34.360
Fong.

17:35.880 --> 17:37.280
I'm sorry.

17:38.760 --> 17:40.240
I'm so sorry.

17:43.360 --> 17:45.120
Don't touch me.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.160
Fong.

17:48.200 --> 17:51.000
Thap, go away.

17:52.280 --> 17:53.480
I'm sorry.

17:57.400 --> 17:58.400
Fong.

17:59.080 --> 18:01.040
Fong.

18:01.120 --> 18:02.560
Take a deep breath.

18:02.640 --> 18:04.600
Fong, you're going to be okay.
Fong, be strong.

18:05.200 --> 18:07.560
Take a deep breath. Breathe.

18:09.040 --> 18:10.680
You guys really love each other.

18:11.280 --> 18:13.080
Our grade 12-1.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.800
Friendship

18:20.840 --> 18:22.280
is really beautiful.

18:23.000 --> 18:24.600
Just like back then.

18:37.480 --> 18:38.880
Back then,

18:38.960 --> 18:41.040
you guys must have really enjoyed it.

18:41.640 --> 18:42.880
Isn't it weird?

18:42.960 --> 18:45.240
Good friends

18:45.320 --> 18:47.600
can tear each other apart

18:47.680 --> 18:50.680
when something like this comes up.

18:59.840 --> 19:02.800
Targeting someone

19:02.880 --> 19:05.200
must be some kind of entertainment

19:05.280 --> 19:06.120
for you guys.

19:12.280 --> 19:13.840
And that

19:13.920 --> 19:15.480
is who you are.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.680
When there was someone to hate,

19:19.120 --> 19:21.360
your bond became even stronger.

19:22.880 --> 19:24.720
This is very interesting.

19:25.440 --> 19:26.600
I wonder

19:27.040 --> 19:28.640
how long can you love each other.

19:28.720 --> 19:29.960
What is it, Nanno?

19:35.080 --> 19:36.480
The question is,

19:37.200 --> 19:39.560
"What did you drink?"

19:43.200 --> 19:44.720
Bitch, did you spike our food?

19:45.560 --> 19:46.840
Not the food.

19:47.520 --> 19:49.720
The drinks.

19:58.280 --> 20:00.160
The important thing is

20:00.240 --> 20:03.320
you will all die soon.

20:13.040 --> 20:14.400
-What?
-What?

20:14.480 --> 20:15.400
-Shit.
-What's wrong?

20:15.480 --> 20:16.560
What the hell?

20:18.760 --> 20:20.400
It's a shame, really.

20:20.880 --> 20:22.000
There is only one shot

20:22.880 --> 20:24.800
of the antidote.

20:25.920 --> 20:26.920
Shit.

20:32.600 --> 20:33.640
Hey.

20:34.520 --> 20:36.040
Meng, help me.

20:36.120 --> 20:38.360
-I'm in pain, too, asshole.
-Meng, you fucker.

20:42.720 --> 20:44.080
Give me the antidote, asshole!

20:49.000 --> 20:49.960
Hey.

20:50.040 --> 20:50.920
-Hey!
-Hey!

21:27.800 --> 21:29.680
Guys, get it together!

22:51.200 --> 22:52.480
I made it.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.840
Chai, congratulations.

22:55.920 --> 22:56.920
Right now,

22:57.000 --> 22:59.720
the antidote is in your blood.

23:07.760 --> 23:08.880
I'm sorry, Chai.

23:09.480 --> 23:12.440
Fuck you. I'm going to kill you!

23:12.720 --> 23:14.680
Guys, the antidote is in his blood.

23:14.760 --> 23:15.840
Kill him!

23:17.200 --> 23:18.680
Hey, come help me hit him!

23:19.160 --> 23:20.280
Die!

23:21.400 --> 23:22.360
Just die already!

23:55.560 --> 23:56.560
Kai.

23:57.240 --> 23:58.720
Will it work?

23:58.800 --> 24:00.200
I'm not sure,

24:01.160 --> 24:02.320
but we have to try.

24:46.560 --> 24:48.080
I'm sorry, guys.

24:48.520 --> 24:50.480
I couldn't help it.

24:51.840 --> 24:53.120
I...

24:53.200 --> 24:55.080
didn't poison anyone.

24:55.160 --> 24:56.680
Just kidding.

25:00.760 --> 25:02.400
What do you call it?

25:07.760 --> 25:09.160
Mass hysteria.

25:10.720 --> 25:11.920
You bitch!

25:12.000 --> 25:13.560
Why did you do this?

25:14.680 --> 25:17.080
Don't make such a scary face.

25:17.480 --> 25:19.480
It was just a small joke.

25:19.920 --> 25:21.720
I didn't even think you would believe me.

25:27.600 --> 25:29.120
-Hey.
-Get Chai down.

25:29.960 --> 25:30.840
Sit.

25:33.600 --> 25:34.560
What

25:35.440 --> 25:37.160
are you guys going to do to me?

25:38.000 --> 25:39.760
I'll ask you again, you bitch.

25:39.840 --> 25:41.160
Why the fuck did you do it?

25:43.200 --> 25:45.160
Well, everyone forgot about me.

25:45.560 --> 25:47.680
I just wanted you to remember.

25:48.040 --> 25:49.000
How was it?

25:49.520 --> 25:51.360
Can you remember me now?

25:57.480 --> 25:58.760
Wit.

25:59.240 --> 26:01.040
Why didn't you tell me you like violence?

26:01.560 --> 26:03.400
I like violence, too.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.160
Why are you messing with us?

26:05.880 --> 26:06.800
Me?

26:07.400 --> 26:08.680
I was the culprit?

26:09.800 --> 26:12.920
Aren't you guys the ones

26:14.080 --> 26:15.800
who hurt and killed each other?

26:19.520 --> 26:21.240
I haven't done anything.

26:22.800 --> 26:24.160
And you said you loved each other.

26:24.680 --> 26:25.680
United.

26:38.200 --> 26:41.520
So this is your true self.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.600
Actually,

27:42.680 --> 27:44.680
I didn't poison you.

27:45.160 --> 27:46.920
I didn't tell you to drink

27:47.800 --> 27:49.600
what was in the syringe

27:50.600 --> 27:52.400
and the blood.

27:54.480 --> 27:55.840
It couldn't be helped.

28:10.280 --> 28:11.280
Hey.

28:12.760 --> 28:14.280
Thank you so much.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.080
If you guys weren't my friends,

28:17.680 --> 28:19.480
I wouldn't have anyone to talk to.

28:48.040 --> 28:49.120
PSYCHO BITCH

28:49.200 --> 28:50.560
CRAZY BITCH TALKING TO NOTHING

28:52.040 --> 28:53.680
Many people think

28:53.760 --> 28:55.400
that the time spent in school

28:55.480 --> 28:57.840
is the most beautiful time in their lives.

28:58.280 --> 29:00.600
We graduate,

29:01.000 --> 29:03.120
walk away with friendship

29:03.200 --> 29:06.600
and good memories in our hearts,

29:07.240 --> 29:09.200
and we go on with our lives.

29:09.880 --> 29:11.680
But the graduation

29:12.240 --> 29:14.480
may not be the end like you think.

29:15.120 --> 29:17.960
It may be the beginning of something

29:18.320 --> 29:19.880
much scarier than that.

30:44.520 --> 30:45.520
Shit.

30:45.920 --> 30:47.200
I had a nightmare.

30:49.520 --> 30:50.640
It was really realistic.

32:01.840 --> 32:03.440
So where should we do this next year?

32:29.560 --> 32:31.680
It was really fun like what everyone said.

32:32.120 --> 32:34.600
Life in school is beautiful.

32:44.320 --> 32:46.040
School where we have teachers
as role models,

32:47.800 --> 32:50.200
teaching us right from wrong,

32:54.920 --> 32:56.520
telling us to apologize

32:56.600 --> 32:59.120
so that we can make another mistake

32:59.200 --> 33:02.400
and ending up having to apologize forever.

33:03.560 --> 33:04.760
I'm sorry, Nanno.

33:05.240 --> 33:06.640
I'm sorry.

33:07.360 --> 33:08.720
You're sorry again?

33:09.200 --> 33:10.200
It makes us realize

33:11.000 --> 33:13.520
that we have to do everything

33:13.600 --> 33:16.080
to be more special than others,

33:16.160 --> 33:18.680
and we will find out in the end

33:18.760 --> 33:20.040
that it's not worth it at all.

33:22.920 --> 33:25.920
It tells us that beauty
is the most important thing in our lives,

33:27.360 --> 33:29.280
and if we can't be more beautiful,

33:30.040 --> 33:31.840
then we should just make
others less beautiful.

33:38.040 --> 33:39.960
It tells us

33:40.040 --> 33:41.840
that if we worship money,

33:42.360 --> 33:44.520
money will be more valuable

33:44.720 --> 33:46.040
than being human.

33:50.120 --> 33:51.440
It tells us

33:52.000 --> 33:54.560
that even the weak can be evil

33:55.200 --> 33:56.960
if they have power.

34:01.800 --> 34:03.640
And just like what everyone already knows,

34:03.920 --> 34:07.240
karma is the consequence of an action.

34:14.320 --> 34:15.960
That's enough!

34:16.440 --> 34:17.719
Fuck! That's enough!

34:38.440 --> 34:39.800
Bam, open the door!

34:40.360 --> 34:41.560
Why won't it come off?

34:42.080 --> 34:43.280
Everybody!

34:44.679 --> 34:45.960
Where is everybody?

34:46.760 --> 34:47.600
Everyone!

34:47.679 --> 34:49.360
I WISH EVERYONE WILL DISAPPEAR

34:50.080 --> 34:52.520
Hanno.

34:52.600 --> 34:54.040
Hanno.

34:54.120 --> 34:55.639
Hanno.

34:55.719 --> 34:57.480
Hanno.

34:58.040 --> 34:59.600
Hanno.

35:12.520 --> 35:14.080
I did it for everyone.

35:15.160 --> 35:16.400
Don't you see

35:16.480 --> 35:17.800
that these people

35:18.680 --> 35:21.440
are ruining the educational system?

35:21.520 --> 35:23.080
I did the right thing.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.160
I did it for everyone.

35:33.360 --> 35:34.600
Next time,

35:34.680 --> 35:37.560
I might become the new student
in your school.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.440
Be prepared.

35:39.520 --> 35:40.840
See you.

35:50.440 --> 35:52.440
Subtitle translation by Danaya Olarikded
